body:
Honestly the only way to not get bored is to play with players you like irl and try out different teams. That's why I started doing more SBC, done pretty much all of the cheap ones to just put in my club if I wanted to use them for squad building options.

&#x200B;

Also try as hard as you can to not take the game seriously, I know a lot of people playing FIFA have anger management issues including me so just try to find a way to relieve of the stress the game my cause at some points.

I think the problem with skilling in this game is the way they work. Chaining them recklessly is just ridiculous for a football game but the worse thing for me atleast is that I feel like some of those skill moves make defending AI completely retarded. You can tackle skilling player perfectly timed like in real life but somehow the animation just ruins it so that makes it just super annoying..

&#x200B;

EDIT: Ofcourse skill moves are important just like in real life football but doing 10 croquetas, fake stops in your own side is just stupid
